---
import { PIPELINE } from "../data";
---

<section class="section" id="usar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Usar</p>
    <h2 class="h2">Duas camadas. Você escolhe quando usar cada uma.</h2>
    <p class="lede">O básico funciona em qualquer pasta. O pipeline completo liga em cada projeto com <code>coff init</code>.</p>

    <div class="layers">
      <article class="layer">
        <p class="tag">Global · em qualquer pasta</p>
        <h3>Ajuda do dia a dia</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><code><span class="pfx">/</span>coff-research</code> pesquisa e resume</li>
          <li><code><span class="pfx">/</span>coff-validate</code> testa e corrige</li>
          <li><code><span class="pfx">/</span>coff-create-pr</code> abre o PR</li>
          <li>regras: português, segurança, sem commit sem pedir</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="when">Vem com <code>coff install</code></p>
      </article>

      <div class="plus" aria-hidden="true">+</div>

      <article class="layer project">
        <p class="tag">Projeto · depois do coff init</p>
        <h3>Pipeline completo</h3>
        <pre class="tree" aria-label="Pastas criadas no projeto"><span>meu-app/</span>
<span>├─ .harness/</span>     <i>memória: plano, features, decisões</i>
<span data-only-ai="claude">├─ .claude/</span><span data-only-ai="codex">├─ .codex/ .agents/</span><span data-only-ai="opencode free">├─ .opencode/</span>   <i>skills e agents do pipeline</i>
<span>└─ AGENTS.md</span>     <i>contexto do projeto para a IA</i></pre>
        <p class="when">Os arquivos da IA ficam fora do git. Só a memória entra.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-h">O pipeline, passo a passo</h3>
    <p class="sub-lede">
      Com <code><span class="pfx">/</span>coff-do "o que fazer"</code> ou <code><span class="pfx">/</span>coff-solve &lt;id&gt;</code>, cada etapa é um
      agent especialista. Você só entra em um momento:
    </p>
    <ol class="flow">
      {
        PIPELINE.map((p) => (
          <li class:list={[{ gate: p.gate }]}>
            <b>{p.agent}</b>
            <span>{p.does}</span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
    <p class="hint">Quer só o plano, sem código? Adicione <code>--plan</code>. Projeto com Figma? Rode antes <code><span class="pfx">/</span>coff-styleguide</code>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  code {
    font-size: 0.9em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .layers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1.25fr;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 72px;
  }
  .layer {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px;
    background: var(--bg-elev);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .layer.project {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 45%, var(--line));
  }
  .tag {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--faint);
  }
  .project .tag {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .when {
    margin: auto 0 0;
    padding-top: 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--faint);
  }
  .plus {
    align-self: center;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--faint);
  }
  .tree {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .tree i {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--faint);
  }
  .sub-h {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .sub-lede {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 620px;
  }
  .flow {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    counter-reset: f;
  }
  .flow li {
    counter-increment: f;
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px;
    background: var(--bg-elev);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .flow li::before {
    content: counter(f);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
  }
  .flow li:not(:last-child)::after {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    right: -10px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translate(50%, -50%);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--faint);
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .flow b {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .flow span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .flow .gate {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 10%, var(--bg));
  }
  .flow .gate b {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .hint {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .layers {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .plus {
      justify-self: center;
    }
    .flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .flow li::after {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
